### Application Description – HR RecruitPro

HR RecruitPro is an Android-based Recruitment Management Application developed to support HR professionals in managing recruitment activities.

The application consists of four main screens: Welcome/Login, HR Dashboard, Candidate Management and Reports.

Its main functionality is candidate registration and screening. HR professionals can enter candidate details, select job positions, review qualifications and experience, and view a preliminary screening recommendation.

The dashboard displays recruitment statistics, while the reports section provides a summary of selected, rejected and pending candidates.

The application uses sample candidate data and rule-based screening logic. It is designed as a basic prototype to demonstrate how technology can improve recruitment management and reduce manual HR work.
